40. One important improvement I recommend

If your Power Apps currently creates the records one-by-one, I recommend this sequence:

Power Apps
   │
   ├── Create User 1
   ├── Create User 2
   ├── Create User 3
   │
   └── After ALL records are created
             │
             ▼
       Update one record
       GenerateRequest = Yes
             │
             ▼
       Power Automate

This is much better than:

Create User 1
   ↓
Power Automate immediately starts

because the latter can cause the first flow to see only User 1.


